      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NFRs \u00b7 capacity (100M DAU)\n\n\u2022 Login \u2248 1K rps\n\u2022 Home reads \u2248 10K rps\n\u2022 Transfers \u2248 10K rps\n\u2022 Consistency over availability\n\u2022 ACID \u00b7 idempotent transfers\n\u2022 99.9% availability\n\u2022 Owner-scoped data \u00b7 PII-ready",
      "originalText": "NFRs \u00b7 capacity (100M DAU)\n\n\u2022 Login \u2248 1K rps\n\u2022 Home reads \u2248 10K rps\n\u2022 Transfers \u2248 10K rps\n\u2022 Consistency over availability\n\u2022 ACID \u00b7 idempotent transfers\n\u2022 99.9% availability\n\u2022 Owner-scoped data \u00b7 PII-ready",
